{"id":"c701ad2d561329ae","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-analytical-closure.md","title":"Number Quantifiers and Boolean Closure of Analytical Classes","display":"thm-analytical-closure — Number Quantifiers and Boolean Closure of Analytical Classes","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-analytical-closure","aliases":["68-thm-analytical-closure"],"display":"thm-analytical-closure — Number Quantifiers and Boolean Closure of Analytical Classes","depends_on":["[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]","[[68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§19 p.74 / PDF 83, closure table after 19.3","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-table-and-number-real-quantifier-exchange-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-analytical-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-analytical-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-analytical-closure — Number Quantifiers and Boolean Closure of Analytical Classes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4eb7f663287e8b98\" href=\"?note=4eb7f663287e8b98\" title=\"68-df-analytical-hierarchy\">68-df-analytical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ed8e054bd690153\" href=\"?note=9ed8e054bd690153\" title=\"68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange\">68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§19 p.74 / PDF 83, closure table after 19.3"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-table-and-number-real-quantifier-exchange-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=X_{m,k}\">\\(X=X_{m,k}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4eb7f663287e8b98\" href=\"?note=4eb7f663287e8b98\" title=\"68-df-analytical-hierarchy\">68-df-analytical-hierarchy</a>。下式引入集合投影算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{m,k},A_{m,k}\">\\(E_{m,k},A_{m,k}\\)</span>，其参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}\">\\(R\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\)</span> 为追加数输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{m,k}(R):=\\{(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in R)\\},\\quad A_{m,k}(R):=\\{(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}:\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{m,k}(R):=\\{(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in R)\\},\\quad A_{m,k}(R):=\\{(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}:\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{X\\setminus R:R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}=\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\qquad\\{X\\setminus R:R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}=\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{X\\setminus R:R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}=\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\qquad\\{X\\setminus R:R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}=\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}\\;\\forall R,S\\in\\Gamma\\;(R\\cup S\\in\\Gamma\\land R\\cap S\\in\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}\\;\\forall R,S\\in\\Gamma\\;(R\\cup S\\in\\Gamma\\land R\\cap S\\in\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>提取原书闭包表中后续§20实际使用的部分，不冒称重写了表中每一格。补集交换Σ/Π；有限布尔运算用成对实见证和前缀合并；数全称与实存在的交换由19.1序列实编码完成，其对偶处理数存在。因而两种数投影均保持每个正层级，Δ由交得到。这里仅对一条固定关系的数投影和有限布尔运算断言闭包；任意非有效可数族的合并需要§20的实参数，不能从此式直接推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange","status":"resolved","id":"9ed8e054bd690153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X=X_{m,k}$。$\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。下式引入集合投影算子 $E_{m,k},A_{m,k}$，其参数 $R\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}$；$\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle$ 为追加数输入。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X=X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"E_{m,k},A_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"E_{m,k}(R):=\\{(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in R)\\},\\quad A_{m,k}(R):=\\{(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}:\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in R)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\{X\\setminus R:R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}=\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\qquad\\{X\\setminus R:R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}=\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\}\\;\\forall R,S\\in\\Gamma\\;(R\\cup S\\in\\Gamma\\land R\\cap S\\in\\Gamma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;(E_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\land A_{m,k}(R)\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true}],"bytes":2457,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0d1050ea9a023f8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-closure]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-closure]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-closure|thm-analytical-closure — Number Quantifiers and Boolean Closure of Analytical Classes]]"}],"outgoing":["4eb7f663287e8b98","9ed8e054bd690153"]}